 "remarks": "Spectacular Sunset Views & Spacious 9th-Floor Living at Hayes House! Situated in one of Stamford's established high-rise communities, this beautifully maintained 1BR/1BA condo offers an impressive combination of space, comfort, and convenience. Filled with natural light, the residence features classic parquet hardwood floors, expansive windows, and a generously sized living room with direct access to a private covered balcony showcasing breathtaking sunset views. A dedicated dining area flows seamlessly into the living space, creating an inviting setting for entertaining. The well-equipped galley kitchen features white cabinetry, stainless-steel appliances, ample counter space, and excellent storage. The oversized bedroom easily accommodates a king-size bedroom set with additional room for a sitting area or home office. Multiple closets, including a large walk-in, provide abundant storage. Enjoy reserved garage parking with convenient, step-free access into the building. HOA includes heat, hot water, and central air conditioning. Hayes House amenities include a 24-hour doorman, concierge, fitness center, landscaped courtyard with grills, community room, private storage, bike room, on-site superintendent, laundry facilities, and guest parking. Ideally located minutes from Metro-North, I-95, Downtown Stamford's vibrant restaurants, shopping, parks, and beaches. Enjoy the perfect blend of spacious living, spectacular sunsets, and exceptional convenience in the heart of Stamford!",
